   "d": "A floor strip (Graphite + wax floor) runs 4.7 m from the door toward the hero (weathered steel hoop). The floor path draws you immediately into the heart of the school memories."
  },
  {
   "t": "The Guardian Hoop",
   "d": "The hero stands alone 5.6 m inside the door, 3.5 m tall; nothing else rises above 1.8 m. The central hoop anchors the room, grounding your experience in the weight of history."
  },
  {
   "t": "Structured Exploration",
   "d": "Four product stations (worn wooden station) ring it loosely, 0.4 m from the route at the closest. The scattered stations create a rhythm that forces you to explore the space like a player on the court."
  },
  {
   "t": "The Silent Finale",
   "d": "The pay counter (minimalist checkout desk) sits at the back right, where the route ends. The final stop serves as a calm conclusion to your immersive journey through the gym."
  }
